    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like the only \"mess\" that would actually work is if everything just stopped. like, if i wasn't even a part of the cage anymore. if the mess is just a way to get peace, then why does it feel like the only way to find peace is to just... not be here? is that just me being dramatic, or is there a logic to it?",
